案 <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="/services/tmall-business-weekly-report/">了解天猫经营周报服务 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="reveal ai-report-evidence-visual"><img src="/assets/visuals/insights-weekly-report.webp" alt="天猫生意参谋AI电商经营周报的退款、投放ROI、流量质量和商品结构分析示例" width="1400" height="636" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div></section><section class="section first-diagnosis-section"><div class="container first-diagnosis-layout"><div class="reveal first-diagnosis-copy"><p class="section-eyebrow">免费 GEO 报告</p><h2>先获取一份品牌 GEO 基础报告，再决定是否做长期优化</h2><p>添加微信并备注“品牌GEO报告”，把品牌公开资料发来。品沐先做基础判断，再告诉你优先补哪一类内容，不以虚假排名或绝对推荐作为承诺。</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?service=geo-report"><span>添加微信领取报告</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><div class="first-diagnosis-grid"><div class="diagnosis-step reveal"><span>01</span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h8l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M9 17l5-5 2 2-5 5H9z"/></svg><h3>你发来什么</h3><p>品牌名称、官网或店铺链接、主要平台、目标市场和当前最想解决的问题。</p></div><div class="diagnosis-step reveal"><span>02</span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"/></svg><h3>我们先看什么</h3><p>AI 搜索可见度、品牌事实一致性、技术可抓取性、内容证据和外部信源。</p></div><div class="diagnosis-step reveal"><span>03</span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8 12 2.5 2.5L16 9"/></svg><h3>你会得到什么</h3><p>一份公开信息版初步报告：问题优先级、证据缺口和未来 30 至 90 天动作建议。</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section method-section"><div class="container"><div class="reveal section-intro "><h2>我们用一套可落地的方法，拆解电商增长问题</h2><p>品沐咨询不是只给方向，而是通过诊断、策略、执行陪跑和复盘机制，把复杂的电商增长问题拆成可执行动作。</p></div><div class="method-line"><div class="reveal method-step"><span class="step-index">01</span><div class="method-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-4-4"/></svg></div><h3>诊断</h3><strong>看清问题在哪里</strong><p>多维度诊断现状，发现增长机会点</p></div><div class="reveal method-step"><span class="step-index">02</span><div class="method-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18h6"/><path d="M10 22h4"/><path d="M8 14a6 6 0 1 1 8 0c-1 1-1 2-1 4H9c0-2 0-3-1-4z"/></svg></div><h3>策略</h3><strong>明确增长优先级</strong><p>制定增长策略与执行路径，明确关键动作</p></div><div class="reveal method-step"><span class="step-index">03</span><div class="method-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15c2-6 7-10 14-10 0 7-4 12-10 14z"/><path d="M9 19l-4 2 2-4"/><circle cx="15" cy="9" r="2"/></svg></div><h3>落地</h3><strong>形成可执行动作</strong><p>陪品牌把动作拆清楚，确保策略有效落地</p></div><div class="reveal method-step"><span class="step-index">04</span><div class="method-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v9h9"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9"/></svg></div><h3>复盘</h3><strong>用数据验证结果</strong><p>数据复盘分析，评估效果与问题</p></div><div class="reveal method-step"><span class="step-index">05</span><div class="method-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-14.9 4"/><path d="M4 16v5h5"/><path d="M4 12A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8"/><path d="M20 8V3h-5"/></svg></div><h3>迭代</h3><strong>持续优化增长模型</strong><p>优化迭代策略，持续提升增长效果</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section cases-preview" id="cases"><div class="container"><div class="reveal section-intro "><h2>真实项目经验，沉淀可复用的增长方法</h2><p>案例均来自真实项目，现有内容已经核对；因客户保密协议采用匿名方式呈现，并隐去客户名称及可识别细节。</p></div><div class="home-case-grid"><div class="reveal"><article class="case-card"><a class="case-image" href="/cases/womenswear-refund-optimization/" aria-label="查看某高客单女装品牌：从退款问题入手，重构内容与转化链路"><picture><source srcset="/assets/cases/womenswear-refund-optimization.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets/cases/womenswear-refund-optimization.png" alt="服饰鞋包品牌在天猫平台的退款率优化 / 页面优化 / 用户预期管理项目案例" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"></picture></a><div class="case-card-body"><div class="tag-row"><span>服饰鞋包</span><span>天猫</span></div><h3><a href="/cases/womenswear-refund-optimization/">某高客单女装品牌：从退款问题入手，重构内容与转化链路</a></h3><p>该品牌具备一定线下基础和设计师调性，但线上销售长期受到高退款率影响。品沐从退款原因、版型表达、主图详情页、客服话术和会员承接入手，帮助品牌建立可持续的退款优化机制。</p><a class="outline-link" href="/cases/womenswear-refund-optimization/">查看服饰鞋包电商优化案例 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article></div><div class="reveal"><article class="case-card"><a class="case-image" href="/cases/personal-care-device-positioning/" aria-label="查看某个护电器品牌：围绕差旅场景，重塑产品卖点表达"><picture><source srcset="/assets/cases/personal-care-device-positioning.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets/cases/personal-care-device-positioning.png" alt="个护电器品牌在京东 / 天猫 / 内容平台平台的商品卖点重构 / 页面优化 / 直播话术优化项目案例" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"></picture></a><div class="case-card-body"><div class="tag-row"><span>个护电器</span><span>京东 / 天猫 / 内容平台</span></div><h3><a href="/cases/personal-care-device-positioning/">某个护电器品牌：围绕差旅场景，重塑产品卖点表达</a></h3><p>该品牌产品具备便携、双功能和差旅使用优势，但原有表达较为分散。品沐围绕真实使用场景，重新梳理产品核心卖点，优化主图、详情页、直播脚本和内容表达。</p><a class="outline-link" href="/cases/personal-care-device-positioning/">查看个护电器电商优化案例 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article></div><div class="reveal"><article class="case-card"><a class="case-image" href="/cases/tea-brand-platform-synergy/" aria-label="查看某茶饮品牌：多平台经营下的内容、直播与店铺转化协同"><picture><source srcset="/assets/cases/tea-brand-platform-synergy.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets/cases/tea-brand-platform-synergy.png" alt="茶饮食品品牌在天猫 / 京东 / 抖音 / 视频号平台的平台运营陪跑 / 内容种草 / 活动复盘项目案例" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"></picture></a><div class="case-card-body"><div class="tag-row"><span>茶饮食品</span><span>天猫 / 京东 / 抖音 / 视频号</span></div><h3><a href="/cases/tea-brand-platform-synergy/">某茶饮品牌：多平台经营下的内容、直播与店铺转化协同</a></h3><p>该茶饮品牌同时经营多个平台，但内容、直播、店铺和用户承接之间缺少统一节奏。品沐协助品牌梳理平台分工、活动节奏、直播复盘和内容承接路径。</p><a class="outline-link" href="/cases/tea-brand-platform-synergy/">查看茶饮食品电商优化案例 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article></div><div class="reveal"><article class="case-card"><a class="case-image" href="/cases/children-nutrition-compliance/" aria-label="查看某儿童营养品牌：在合规前提下优化产品表达与平台运营节奏"><picture><source srcset="/assets/cases/children-nutrition-compliance.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets/cases/children-nutrition-compliance.png" alt="营养健康品牌在天猫 / 内容平台平台的页面优化 / 合规表达 / 活动运营项目案例" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"></picture></a><div class="case-card-body"><div class="tag-row"><span>营养健康</span><span>天猫 / 内容平台</span></div><h3><a href="/cases/children-nutrition-compliance/">某儿童营养品牌：在合规前提下优化产品表达与平台运营节奏</a></h3><p>该品牌面向儿童营养消费场景，既要讲清产品价值，又要避免平台合规风险。品沐协助品牌优化页面表达、活动节奏、内容方向和客服沟通口径。</p><a class="outline-link" href="/cases/children-nutrition-compliance/">查看营养健康电商优化案例 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article></div></div><div class="center-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/cases/"><span>查看全部项目经验</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="section home-insights-section"><div class="container"><div class="reveal section-intro "><h2>经营洞察：把具体问题拆成可执行判断</h2><p>围绕店铺转化、商品结构、客服、直播、会员复购、经营周报、退款治理和投放复盘，沉淀可直接用于团队复盘的方法与清单。</p></div><div class="insight-card-grid"><article class="insight-card reveal"><div class="insight-card-meta"><span>服务选择</span><time datetime="2026-07-16">2026-07-16</time></div><h3><a href="/insights/ecommerce-consulting-vs-operation-coaching-vs-agency/">咨询、陪跑与代运营怎么选</a></h3><p>三种合作方式的核心差异不在名称，而在谁做判断、谁负责执行、谁拥有账号和数据，以及如何验收。</p><div class="insight-card-footer"><span>约 9 分钟</span><a class="outline-link" href="/insights/ecommerce-consulting-vs-operation-coaching-vs-agency/">阅读咨询、陪跑与代运营怎么选 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article><article class="insight-card reveal"><div class="insight-card-meta"><span>顾问评估</span><time datetime="2026-07-16">2026-07-16</time></div><h3><a href="/insights/how-to-evaluate-ecommerce-consultant/">电商顾问可信度核验清单</a></h3><p>可信度不应靠头衔、客户名单或增长承诺判断，而要核验问题诊断、证据边界、交付物、数据安全和复盘机制。</p><div class="insight-card-footer"><span>约 9 分钟</span><a class="outline-link" href="/insights/how-to-evaluate-ecommerce-consultant/">阅读电商顾问可信度核验清单 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article><article class="insight-card reveal"><div class="insight-card-meta"><span>GEO衡量</span><time datetime="2026-07-16">2026-07-16</time></div><h3><a href="/insights/geo-roi-attribution-for-ecommerce-brands/">品牌 GEO ROI 归因方法</a></h3><p>GEO不能只看AI是否提及品牌。应分别记录引用、访问、用户自报、有效询盘、商机和成交，并保留无法归因。</p><div class="insight-card-footer"><span>约 9 分钟</span><a class="outline-link" href="/insights/geo-roi-attribution-for-ecommerce-brands/">阅读品牌 GEO ROI 归因方法 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article><article class="insight-card reveal"><div class="insight-card-meta"><span>AI经营工具</span><time datetime="2026-07-16">2026-07-16</time></div><h3><a href="/insights/ai-ecommerce-weekly-report-vs-manual-report/">AI周报与人工周报的区别</a></h3><p>AI适合读取、标准化、计算和生成初稿；经营判断仍需要核对口径、活动背景、异常订单和执行条件。</p><div class="insight-card-footer"><span>约 9 分钟</span><a class="outline-link" href="/insights/ai-ecommerce-weekly-report-vs-manual-report/">阅读AI周报与人工周报的区别 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article><article class="insight-card reveal"><div class="insight-card-meta"><span>店铺转化</span><time datetime="2026-07-16">2026-07-16</time></div><h3><a href="/insights/store-traffic-no-conversion-diagnosis/">店铺有流量没转化排查法</a></h3><p>有流量没成交时，不建议先增加预算。应按流量匹配、商品结构、主图首屏、详情页、信任证明和客服承接逐段定位损耗。</p><div class="insight-card-footer"><span>约 8 分钟</span><a class="outline-link" href="/insights/store-traffic-no-conversion-diagnosis/">阅读店铺有流量没转化排查法 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article><article class="insight-card reveal"><div class="insight-card-meta"><span>数据诊断</span><time datetime="2026-07-16">2026-07-16</time></div><h3><a href="/insights/business-advisor-data-diagnosis-checklist/">生意参谋数据诊断资料清单</a></h3><p>有效数据诊断不需要先导出所有报表，但必须覆盖经营概览、商品、流量、退款、推广和承接，并统一统计周期。</p><div class="insight-card-footer"><span>约 8 分钟</span><a class="outline-link" href="/insights/business-advisor-data-diagnosis-checklist/">阅读生意参谋数据诊断资料清单 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></article></div><div class="center-actions"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/insights/"><span>查看全部经营洞察</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="section home-faq-section"><div class="container home-faq-grid"><div class="reveal home-faq-intro"><p class="section-eyebrow">DIRECT ANSWERS</p><h2>品牌做电商时，常见问题先直接回答</h2><p>这些回答基于品沐在店铺诊断、经营复盘和运营陪跑中反复遇到的问题。具体项目仍需结合平台、类目、统计周期和团队执行能力判断。</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">带着具体问题咨询品沐 <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item open"><button type="button"><span>品牌如何免费获取一份 GEO 报告？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>添加微信或拨打 13600008584，备注“品牌GEO报告”，并发送品牌名称、官网或店铺链接、主要平台和目标市场。品沐会基于公开信息先做一份品牌 GEO 基础判断，查看 AI 搜索可见度、品牌事实一致性、技术可抓取性、证据化内容和外部信源。报告属于初步分析，不承诺虚假排名或 AI 推荐结果。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>品牌 GEO 基础报告主要看什么？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>报告会先看 AI 搜索能否找到品牌、是否正确理解公司与服务、是否有页面可以被引用，以及官网、平台和外部资料之间的事实是否一致；再给出内容证据、页面结构、站外信源和未来 30 至 90 天的优先动作建议。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>电商店铺有流量但转化率低，应该先检查什么？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>先不要急着继续加预算。建议依次检查流量是否匹配目标人群、主图是否讲清购买理由、SKU与价格梯度是否合理、详情页能否消除顾虑，以及客服、评价和问大家是否承接成交。品沐会把这些环节放在同一条转化链路中判断优先级。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>天猫店铺退款率偏高，品沐咨询会怎么分析？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>先确认退款率、退款金额和统计周期的口径，再按商品、尺码或规格、页面表达、客服承诺、履约体验和人群来源拆解。若当期退款金额高于当期成交，还需要核查是否包含历史订单退款，不能直接把问题归因于本期流量。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>品沐咨询是代运营公司还是电商顾问公司？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>品沐更偏向电商咨询、经营诊断和运营陪跑，不承诺包办全部店铺执行。合作重点是帮助品牌找出增长卡点、明确动作优先级、形成可执行材料，并通过周报、会议和专项复盘推动现有团队落地。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>AI电商经营周报会分析哪些数据？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>第一阶段主要读取天猫和生意参谋相关的经营概览、商品、流量来源、客户、客服、直播、光合内容、推广计划和退款报表。报告会统一支付金额、净销售额、退款和推广花费等口径，再输出经营判断、风险提示、图表快照和下周期行动清单。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>不在广州的品牌可以和品沐咨询合作吗？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>可以。品沐咨询位于广州，可通过线上会议、数据文件、协作文档和周期复盘服务全国品牌。需要现场访谈、拍摄或驻场支持的项目，再根据城市、周期和工作量单独确认。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>品沐咨询和品沐家居、品沐瑜伽是同一家公司吗？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>不是。本官网所称“品沐咨询”特指广州品沐咨询有限公司旗下的 PINMOO 品牌，主要提供品牌 GEO、电商经营诊断、运营陪跑和 AI 经营工具服务；与品沐家居、品沐瑜伽及其他近似名称主体没有隶属关系。判断主体时，请以本官网的公司名称、官方域名 pinmooconsulting.com 和公开联系方式为准。</p></div></div><div class="faq-item "><button type="button"><span>品沐咨询可以为茶叶和新会陈皮品牌做 GEO 吗？</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>可以。品沐会先统一品牌、公司、产地、产品、适用场景和证据边界，再围绕茶叶电商、新会陈皮电商、平台经营、内容种草、商品页面和 AI 搜索可见度设计页面与内容。涉及年份、等级、产地、检测或功效的描述，需要品牌提供可核验资料，不能用宣传语替代证据。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section about-preview"><div class="container about-preview-grid"><div class="reveal"><h2>懂品牌 GEO，也懂电商实战</h2><p>品沐咨询是广州品沐咨询有限公司旗下的品牌 GEO 与电商增长咨询服务，由鲍俊文（沐风、BarryBao）主理，面向消费品牌提供 AI 搜索可见度优化、品牌事实库与证据化内容建设，以及电商经营诊断、运营陪跑、页面优化、投放复盘和 AI 经营工具服务。</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/about/"><span>了解品沐咨询与顾问背景</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><div class="reveal office-visual"><img src="/assets/about-brand.svg" alt="广州品沐咨询有限公司的品牌 GEO 与电商实战协同方法" loading="lazy"></div></div></section><div class="container"><div class="reveal cta-band-wrap"><section class="cta-band"><div class="cta-band-icon"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-12.7 7.4L3 20l1.1-5.1A8.5 8.5 0 1 1 21 11.5z"/></svg></div><div class="cta-band-text"><h2>添加微信，免费获取一份品牌 GEO 基础报告</h2><p>发送品牌名称、官网或店铺链接、主要平台和目标市场。品沐会基于公开信息先做一份品牌 GEO 基础判断。</p></div><div class="cta-band-contact"><strong>微信 / 手机同号：13600008584</strong><span>添加微信并备注“品牌GEO报告”，免费获取一份基于公开信息的品牌 GEO 基础报告。</span></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?service=geo-report"><span>免费领取 GEO 报告</span></a></section></div><